        <obo:IAO_0000115>Height of the palate more than 2 SD above the mean (objective) or palatal height at the level of the first permanent molar more than twice the height of the teeth (subjective).</obo:IAO_0000115>
        <oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>HP:0000156</oboInOwl:hasAlternativeId>
